    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18890" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψίνθ-ιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wormwood, Artemisia Absinthium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.12.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψινθίῳ κατέπασας Ἀττικὸν μέλι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					708
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄψινθος</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, but ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				8.11
			</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψινθία</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψίνθιον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβρότονον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			=
			<i>Artemisia monosperma,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				5.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θαλάσσιον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέριφον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.23
			</span></i>.</div>
